{"seq":2,"slug":"computing-and-intelligence","title":"《计算机器与智能》","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/alan-turing/major-works/computing-and-intelligence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-1950-paper","title":"一九五〇年的论文","url":"/c/people/alan-turing/major-works/computing-and-intelligence/the-1950-paper","wordCount":2127,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-foundations-of-ai","title":"人工智能的奠基","url":"/c/people/alan-turing/major-works/computing-and-intelligence/the-foundations-of-ai","wordCount":2002,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 《计算机器与智能》\n\n本章呈现图灵一九五〇年的论文《计算机器与智能》。这篇论文，深入探讨了机器智能，提出了著名的图灵测试，为人工智能这门学科奠定了思想的基础。两篇文档，分别呈现一九五〇年的论文，以及人工智能的奠基。\n"}